#: scenario8:scenario8_4AF3C7D2_339F_448B_B256_1268AAE11D3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3587a9ef1c9fb272658e44e0bd7120f6b66a3d96a04fb8871a23ad5baeef9fc
#. default-sha256: 4513459d081738e933f8874cc8d79700167e17e80666d4fb794a919a563ab94d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4AF3C7D2_339F_448B_B256_1268AAE11D3D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫As you "
"know, I am not from this land."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫如你所知，我"
"是异国人。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F654B6ED_85D3_4495_9C45_7DB4B48E14FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a5d618a03526ba83e6c9db54aed7893ed832c8fdc4047df49a27056d0c180d5
#. default-sha256: 6d77e696e009b0fb1421fa711b6170a8d2d0448eccf43200de55dfa43b2dde4f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F654B6ED_85D3_4495_9C45_7DB4B48E14FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The issue is,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫可是……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7CA8498D_9531_4EE3_B774_EF2F2164929C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a6a79d68a3b7ef34add552bc52ef8369d1985faa2f55c5a72daf11bbbdabe32
#. default-sha256: 4cd9ace88be31e28bbbd0f3eccdd6336c543a032e41271d0200f451b42c0369c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7CA8498D_9531_4EE3_B774_EF2F2164929C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t know any more about where I came from than you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我并不清楚自己到底是什么人。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_62E45312_CA49_40BA_A281_F36395ADB333
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34c2d2ddc633e82dd96db4f28f166a7620928ae5115a26fe64417f6829a64a0e
#. default-sha256: 533c1b57618996104e57dfef262c8d70576780d2d999f477c13c5f81a526369a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_62E45312_CA49_40BA_A281_F36395ADB333"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫most of my memories are gone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫失去了记忆。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_46ABE5C8_45D1_4BD6_B048_61D189617F6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bf3ee7c800f2acc17c1b5ab6fa52e8818e72fb6d1c792ca8d1161115b64f02d
#. default-sha256: 613fee6f337e13eebbd6e4b7173de72fdeecd0793ae415cdf2b14cf6ba2be7ae
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_46ABE5C8_45D1_4BD6_B048_61D189617F6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or perhaps a messenger."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫或是其他国家的使者……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EB475B59_2055_49A4_8FC2_25857E677057
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e1bc459a3938b5bc2b8c9c3a2541b52ac35f80336feada78510899c75691847
#. default-sha256: 9c14466d589f4b64f646120ff095b20d4984498651f8e5477709c192b52b610b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EB475B59_2055_49A4_8FC2_25857E677057"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I vaguely remember being waylaid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We were vastly outnumbered, massacred with little "
"resistance.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Or at least, I assume that’s what happened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫我还记得被什么人袭击。⟪k:1⟫对方人多势众，⟪k:2⟫我们无力抵抗，就此败落。⟪k:3⟫……但，⟪k:4⟫这都只"
"是我的猜测。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_91A0BF4C_661D_4FD5_92CC_7791798CE7F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2760a1b317b49c7946c7e397644e7d70a58060ecf7e139af83d7fcffd349628
#. default-sha256: 8ddf9e3670b260e6be467620eccb23e613f8841ccad46f7d803bbbb0f9a4691e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_91A0BF4C_661D_4FD5_92CC_7791798CE7F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was a slave for one grueling, torturous year.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No one treated me like a human "
"being.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There was no one from the same part of the world as me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫作为奴隶度过了屈辱的一年……⟪k:1⟫受尽了非人的折磨。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫没有见过像是同乡的人——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D0CD0533_F04D_43F6_BA35_FF5B6565F2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4e5e850f23e89602a0c56bd13bf0bb058bbf738fe69ae45050031e41238e467
#. default-sha256: 52c99b2e9b500e74d7642c843a163a93af2862973b23a8d20472588e04b29ab2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D0CD0533_F04D_43F6_BA35_FF5B6565F2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And there was no one to come to my aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫也没有人来救我。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B49E446F_A5CA_4682_9308_20113A8DA388
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb4e855e095b23e499d987b0073233064e58744a42a00c2c16745d2e15a6eeb3
#. default-sha256: 178f90181464aca2fd8b488d374b38847766e506a8c2a44b93dfffb04e872df4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B49E446F_A5CA_4682_9308_20113A8DA388"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to be honest, I think I was happier ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ understanding what people were saying "
"about me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫可是……⟪k:1⟫或许不能理解他们在说什么，⟪k:2⟫反而更好。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5C79E8CC_1756_4827_82A1_033BDCF716E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36c3d3a6a03ff9b23ae09e6917f248a76d9269067b5dec7d1ed64d7e9e1d40fa
#. default-sha256: a4e7f270fb30735d82229cb753c1585a078263cb115957fc4544fc02cdf120a0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5C79E8CC_1756_4827_82A1_033BDCF716E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the longer I was treated as something less than human,⟪k:1⟫the more I began to question "
"whether I really ⟪k:2⟫was⟪k:3⟫ one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫长时间受到非人的对待，⟪k:1⟫我开始逐渐觉得，⟪k:2⟫我可能真的不是人。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5D4E2E70_2BA6_4308_8F92_A45288D8602A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d1b01a13096c6e5d7da8774fbc236ca7a1ac5b0ca3560f5e3b12e2c9d7075aa
#. default-sha256: 9f0a4d677f9ed808d7b4f5f3624d3bf3ffd1e8f984dbd848b7f3f30e279849ec
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5D4E2E70_2BA6_4308_8F92_A45288D8602A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was packed front to back with slaves—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫or soon-to-be slaves, I suppose I "
"should say."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫马车正在去往其他城镇的途中，⟪k:1⟫车上还有许多其他的奴隶。⟪k:2⟫或者应该说……是即将成为奴隶之"
"人。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5598B724_4321_4338_A2FA_062604A78166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91f60685a14cec0ee42ec0cf37d337719f08806f9846280842d7b6c9c31ba8f9
#. default-sha256: 597f8247eadb619c6ad9e3862a18a21c264c83de1c7d788d6b79b71583aaf661
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5598B724_4321_4338_A2FA_062604A78166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But beyond that, I didn’t think much of it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t find it disturbing or "
"unpleasant..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫可是，⟪k:1⟫我并不想去追究。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫并不会觉得恶心，⟪k:4⟫也没有觉得厌恶……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B22846FD_AE3C_4CE5_B1E7_CBF181370F41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 045a62977e35bf5ddb04e2158c83be4f2d95cf3b545a42a546f0966900d98793
#. default-sha256: f33af8f593fe0f339dbcff1d75760a609480f38fffbf8958b580211d5747825f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B22846FD_AE3C_4CE5_B1E7_CBF181370F41"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At my question, the girl turned her head up to look at me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Surprise crossed her "
"face for a few brief seconds,⟪k:3⟫but that was her only reaction to my appearance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫听到我的提问，⟪k:1⟫那个少女抬起头。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫她看到我的脸有些惊讶，⟪k:4⟫但仅此而已。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_90FE4610_3F11_4A96_8E4F_A3D7F00D11B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb0214c1c13e30a0d627b4cb66b1067bb8615a2b5071a1c0e59fd5c04a4bfe87
#. default-sha256: aa4a29b39f21fbe36bfec76115d1b3ea16147b6b4cc6fd649cbd93311a87a007
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_90FE4610_3F11_4A96_8E4F_A3D7F00D11B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I assume her thought process was roughly the same as mine, so she felt no need to fear me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她可能和我有同样的感受。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫她没有对我流露恐惧。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_85A2FDBC_1AFC_48DF_AC4C_7707E3DE1EB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc46cca9a8ca1c02e9659272de474417f8c167e41acc5e30b72cdab3532629cf
#. default-sha256: 0cd6d06e2896c11ea35a62d33a9f15a3b2bb6d596773a5daf6aa98f7127d4a80
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85A2FDBC_1AFC_48DF_AC4C_7707E3DE1EB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m sad because I didn’t get the chance to show my gratitude to people very dear to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫没能向重要的人们道谢，⟪k:1⟫这让我很悲伤。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_587E1576_703A_451D_82BC_2C5A4C09DD62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 178836d88feda2a72aea808c4c7e71eb096fe9d14eb01c2d9c0033291f4b8def
#. default-sha256: 947f0a8d5775ca435696bddadad807c654ab48c565d80c6e2e7f28c7b66c0382
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_587E1576_703A_451D_82BC_2C5A4C09DD62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫her voice, despite being soft, cut through the crying and wailing of the other slaves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫她的声音很小，⟪k:1⟫却没有淹没在其他奴隶们的哭声和呜咽之中，⟪k:2⟫而是清楚地传入了我耳中。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A555FD47_344D_49EA_8C98_1E6339700658
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75e312b7286088f5a9fa98a45d0ae038c10ffc14db62f575f6a3e32ba93eddec
#. default-sha256: 4eed0c6110597d04ca02b1e630dee58fe8b4824653be5c8a97080f57ab4a6b88
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A555FD47_344D_49EA_8C98_1E6339700658"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I pictured it like... ⟪k:1⟫a single patch of clear water in the middle of a swamp,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫在那个瞬间……我的心中仿佛泛起了澄澈的水波。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫在污浊不堪的沼泽一角，⟪k:3⟫有一汪清澈见底"
"的水——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1523D91D_0AAD_47FB_85DC_F5D0923DFD5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7de7b7326b3cdff6e9f6ce0a42ca2318487e0969ef117e909b6552ec9018480
#. default-sha256: 0579eec8c66fb320e8190792afdf8773395371df04e2f8fc83352bb650801fe3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1523D91D_0AAD_47FB_85DC_F5D0923DFD5B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll apologize... ⟪k:1⟫anything!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果想让我道歉……⟪k:1⟫要我说多少遍都可以……！！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D8E48D86_DFF4_4599_8060_1E6E498FA011
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e8c0f7410f16003d0903d8e84e331d32fb41ddb4c67f0521825054991950a40
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D8E48D86_DFF4_4599_8060_1E6E498FA011"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario8:scenario8_089B583B_F350_4F78_9032_45D919E1EB2B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7694bbc83bba8f280a34f5b76969614f6451e9e05c4af2bc2263b69e1305c46
#. default-sha256: 4593762a5e970c1a6101cfefc8133bdbce3e9c4a4d4348db3f092bade84a376d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_089B583B_F350_4F78_9032_45D919E1EB2B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahahahahahahaha!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……！！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4383889C_5F68_4126_A404_75D6368BC473
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46b7e95adaf4dc4107489b76a6e31459e40751d12a8758ccf9f1b124cd6be826
#. default-sha256: c9c8091906f6af2b67f40e0fd872cd025f93a1acb1df126bf9425c2f770ea4dd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4383889C_5F68_4126_A404_75D6368BC473"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Holding a sword in my hand felt amazingly... ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫right⟪k:8⟫."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Whatever work I once did must have required me to use a blade."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫拿起剑，⟪k:6⟫那种感觉熟悉得连我自己都很惊讶。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫或许我原来的"
"工作就是用剑的。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_89902CC0_AFC6_42A0_A5A4_BBC64B3B4FC1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8090971394746077a12f63a94843e6f3d7d8d4921138271b87934f22cd8a5eb0
#. default-sha256: b9b9fb3a30d53ca9d5da97c221df4912a1a609f3e8d1640567e2f578f8542102
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_89902CC0_AFC6_42A0_A5A4_BBC64B3B4FC1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dead bodies sprawled out around me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Corpses I had made. Lives I had snuffed out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我身边全是尸体。⟪k:1⟫他们都是我杀掉的。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫是我依靠自己的力量……做到的。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A0C1F49_22F0_451C_B592_62052AAB7555
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4866510da438615c235dc9e7d4c05552d78d8cc8ca92609a71058efbcf3169f
#. default-sha256: fcc31d6f321b0fe3082d7bb09e7f42015768342a00f53b26bf7efada3a161b9e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A0C1F49_22F0_451C_B592_62052AAB7555"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t have the words to describe the high it gave me killing those men, the power I felt "
"over them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那时的兴奋感难以言喻……⟪k:1⟫实在太畅快了。⟪k:2⟫我沉醉在自己的力量中。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_ECE749DB_420F_4DC2_AB04_C067F0CDB9CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db4fbeb6d39d26cdf6bcb99406e0791326b60feddfa33b9f93edb97771735abf
#. default-sha256: a81a1c50f208980b72ca8e68867b7b17fe3c40c1ce433223581e04007cf5356e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ECE749DB_420F_4DC2_AB04_C067F0CDB9CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was driven mad by the stench of blood filling the air.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, it just drew out what "
"was always there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫周围的血腥味……让我逐渐陷入疯狂……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不，⟪k:3⟫从最初开始我就已经疯了。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_965466F8_4A8D_4E15_8294_3DB6C0042AF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66e75229dbd6d62c3fea037d2b314dc4712744a02836b5a17aee6f3023166a06
#. default-sha256: 372a8df55097b80dfacf1ee2714da828e25ec5dc089f8d3c3c1a86328011f80d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_965466F8_4A8D_4E15_8294_3DB6C0042AF9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If I weren’t already deranged,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果我是个正常人……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E30A0CCB_D763_4642_86A5_DE4025B02443
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a6222cb26551597ee39259f273bca7a61d8d91b923ad8ddaccda1732d032be0
#. default-sha256: d53a3b521fc2300af05bb725b27fe5e5daae15cc046b0b9415e0321e9fea0b73
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E30A0CCB_D763_4642_86A5_DE4025B02443"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hey. You. Unlock my shackles for me."
